Read and follow `AGENTS.md` and `agent/prompts/system.md`.
Use Codebase Memory MCP (`search_graph`, `trace_path`, `get_code_snippet`) for
structural discovery. Resolve the indexed project by the current checkout's
root path, check its status, and verify source availability before trusting
results. Refresh stale indexes according to `agent/commands/refresh-index.md`.
Use native search for literal text or when the MCP server is unavailable.
